   "text": "Northumbria University London campus (QAHE) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nNorthumbria University London campus (QAHE)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nQA Higher Education partner with Northumbria University to deliver courses at the London Campus, and Pathway programmes at the City Campus in Newcastle. Amid the buzz of London’s business and financial district, you’ll find the London Campus, offering industry-focused courses at undergraduate top-up and postgraduate level in subject areas such as Business, Computing, IT and Project Management. Pathway programmes are delivered in Newcastle and enable International students to develop their English language and academic skills on programmes that are specifically tailored to their chosen progression subject area, with teaching delivered at the main university campus.Our partnership with Northumbria University also extends to Degree Apprenticeships – where we have tailor-built a provision of programmes to provide meaningful and relevant benefits to both employers and learners. All courses at the London Campus, and Pathway programmes delivered in Newcastle, are Northumbria University programmes and are delivered by the University and taught by QA Higher Education staff, approved by the University.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:19\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:19\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £22,000.00\nMin: £1,625.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n23%\n7,705 of 33,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nQA Higher Education (QAHE)\nFounded Year\n1969\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Cameroon, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n23/10/2023\nContract End Date\n20/10/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpiring in 90 days\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://london.northumbria.ac.uk/courses/new-students/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://london.northumbria.ac.uk/courses/new-students/bursaries-and-scholarships/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oy-W-65J8Og\nInternship Details\nhttps://london.northumbria.ac.uk/why-northumbria/careers-and-employability/\nAdditional Information\n-",
